Z||000006||grinthock||05-25-2001||01:03 PM||||Nah you didn't make an ass of yourself.  It's a common mis-conception.  <P>NONE of the fiero's you could buy with power steering, I dunno if they were taken off, never put on or whatever.. OR for what reason.  They were supposed to have a electro-hydrolic system (like the new MR2 Spyder has)<P>Someone around here has one on his car, retrofitted or somethign but i think it was a pump and he ran lines and stuff.||||reg||1
